    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Cost EfficiencyTransporting a single vehicle in a closed container truck generally incurs a higher per‑unit price due to dedicated space and premium handling. The multi‑car covered deck trailer spreads the cost across several vehicles, delivering a more cost‑effective rate for bulk shipments, especially when moving multiple standard cars.</p>
