        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To book car transportation in Bazpur you need a valid government‑issued ID, vehicle registration certificate, insurance policy copy, and a signed service agreement. For corporate or government moves, an IBA‑approved invoice, GST registration number, and e‑Way bill are also mandatory to ensure smooth reimbursement.</p>
