        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our car transport inspection checklist records the vehicle’s exterior condition, mileage, fuel level, and any pre‑existing damages before loading. Photographs and a signed acknowledgment are captured, creating a transparent record that protects both the owner and the carrier against disputes during the Bazpur to hub transit.</p>
