        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car’s movement in real time during the Bazpur transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant alerts for departure, checkpoint arrivals, and delivery, giving you full visibility of your car transportation in Bazpur from start to finish.</p>
