        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 7‑layer body guard wrap suitable for high‑value or antique cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. The 7‑layer wrap combines heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam, and custom wooden crates to cushion against shocks, vibrations, and weather exposure. Paired with our 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, it offers premium protection for luxury, vintage, or delicate automobiles.</p>
